# What's new in this release

### Added

- Allow logins with multisig and singlesig wallets, bitcoin and liquid accounts with a unique PIN.

### Changed

- New Hardware Wallet Onboarding UI;
- Lock Jade on session logout.

### Fixed

 - Fix device list showing previously connected devices;
 - Hide menu entries(rename/archive) for watch only sessions;
 - Show the change address in Verification bottom sheet on Trezor;
 - Fix wallet restore when the corresponding multisig watch-only

- Adds Liquid support for Ledger Nano S;
- Improvements and small fixes for wallets with many utxos;
- Updates gdk to 0.0.26

More info at: https://github.com/Blockstream/green_android/compare/release_3.3.0...release_3.3.2
